            "content": "<p>Handmade in our Bangkok, Thailand workshop. DHL Express Worldwide shipping is included with all orders.</p><p><strong>USA and AU</strong> - 2 to 4 business days</p><p><strong>NZ, CA, EU & Other</strong> - 3 to 5 business days</p>"
