          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How Long Does My Map Take To Make?",
            "content": "<p>All maps are made to order</p><p><strong>From the collection - </strong>3 business days. <a href=\"/collections\" title=\"All collections\">See the collection</a></p><p><strong>Custom - 7</strong> business days - this includes 3 business days for the digital draft, then once you have approved this draft, physical fabrication will take 4 business days. <a href=\"https://originmaps.com/collections/custom\" title=\"CustomTopographicWoodenMapArt\">See custom maps</a></p>"
