          "settings": {
            "title": "Returns Policy",
            "content": "<p><strong>100% satisfaction guarantee</strong></p><p>If you're not satisfied with your map, simply return it within 30 days and once the map has returned to our workshop, a full refund will be remitted. Origin Maps does not cover the return postage cost.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq-2": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What If My Map Arrives Damaged?",
            "content": "<p><strong>100% damage free guarantee</strong></p><p>In the unlikely event that your map arrives damaged please take pictures and get in contact. We will then send you a full replacement at no extra cost.</p><p>If it's just the frame that is damaged, if you prefer we can find a framing store that is local to you and fully reimburse you for the reframing cost.</p><p>Whether you live in the auspicious areas of Adelaide. Or the awe-inspiring alps of Alaska. Origin Maps is committed to giving you a beautiful and unique wooden map, that can be a talking piece and source of pride in your home.</p>"
          }
        },
        "fd3012d4-c85d-42a5-9322-76374ce80ebc": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Sizes",
            "content": "<p><strong>S </strong>- 12 x 16\" - 30 x 40cm</p><p><strong>M </strong>- 18 x 24\" - 45 x 60cm</p><p><strong>L </strong>- 24 x 32\" - 60 x 80cm</p><p><em>These dimensions include the frame</em></p>"
          }
        },
        "b7f39779-f4bb-4b2f-beea-02595bfad36b": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Mounting & Hanging",
            "content": "<p>All sizes come with a wire across the back, making them ready to hang on the wall.</p><p>Alternatively your piece will look great on a desk or shelf just resting against the wall.</p>"
          }
        },
        "62a0e74e-5473-4d77-86c1-6addd1017b77": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Materials",
            "content": "<p>Our topographic wooden maps are crafted from responsibly sourced Double-A grade 1.5mm fine-grained Basswood.</p><p>The frames are made from locally sourced Tasmanian Oak.</p>"
          }
        },
